  message: "Cross-item review 2026-05-17: the 3-file-count ambiguity here has identified upstream causes: INV-tosum (bash/shell alias duplication accounts for ~10 of the 1119/863 gap), INV-hokig (profile.languages vs analyzer-pass exclude-policy inconsistency), and INV-hojus (file-kind vs module-kind double representation explains part of the 809 file-symbol count). This item is the right place to define the documented semantics; the upstream items address the producers."  # c405
